<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vishay raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vishay raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it had raised its rating for Vishay Intertechnology Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The firm kept Pennsylvania-based Vishay at long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- Stock of the electronic components maker opened up 3/4 to 19-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
